{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17602","headline":"永宁里园亭休沐怅然成咏 · 羊士谔","name":"永宁里园亭休沐怅然成咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云景含初夏，休归曲陌深。\n幽帘宜永日，珍树始清阴。\n迟客唯长簟，忘言有匣琴。\n画披灵物态，书见古人心。\n芳草多留步，鲜飙自满襟。\n劳形非立事，潇洒媿头簪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17602.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17602","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}